Z||000002||Cheever2||01-16-2001||12:34 PM||||Don't know how this copy & paste will turn out...<P>Event for which I could not find dates:<BR>Great Pumpkin Run, somewhere in Alabama <P>Here are the others that I was able to find:<BR>March 23-25 	Florida Fiero Weekend<BR>Daytona Beach Florida<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.floridafieros.org" TARGET=_blank>www.floridafieros.org</A>  <BR>also dragon@yourlink.net (Frank Martin)<BR>March 23-25 	Daytona Beach Car Show and Swap Meet<BR>April 7-8	Fiero Roundup V<BR>			San Antonio Texas<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://users.ev1.net/~whitehouse1/" TARGET=_blank>http://users.ev1.net/~whitehouse1/</A> <BR>April 28-29 (not confirmed)<BR>Ed Parks' Swap Meet, at Toney Alabama<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html</A> <BR>May (?)	Southwest Regional Fiero Fest<BR>Norman Oklahoma<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fco.org/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fco.org/index.html</A> <BR>May 19	Fieros At Carlisle<BR>Carlisle Pennsylvania<BR>May 31-June 3Dells Run 2001 A Fiero Odyssey<BR>Chula Vista Resort, Wisconsin<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierokid/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fierokid/</A> <BR>June 8-10	Pontiac Southern Nationals<BR>Dallas Texas<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.dapa.org" TARGET=_blank>www.dapa.org</A> <BR>June 29-July 1	All-GM Nationals<BR>Carlisle Pennsylvania<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A> <BR>July 13-15	Michigan Fiero Festival<BR>Frankenmuth Michigan<BR>July 13-15	Western Regional Fiero Fest <BR>San Leandro California<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A> <BR>July (?) 	Pittsburgh Vintage Grand Prix<BR>Pittsburgh Pennsylvania <BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://trfn.clpgh.org/pvgpa/" TARGET=_blank>http://trfn.clpgh.org/pvgpa/</A> <BR>Aug 2-5	FOCOA Festival<BR>Williamsburg Virginia<BR>Aug 18		Fiero Dutch Classic<BR>Denver Pennsylvania<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A> <BR>Sept 9		FieroRama<BR>Oakbrook Illinois<BR><BR>Sept 22 (not confirmed)<BR>FOCONE Fall Fiero Show<BR>Rutland Massachusetts<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/rutland.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/rutland.htm</A> <BR>Sept 29-30 (not confirmed) <BR>Run For The Hills 6, in North Carolina<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://fiero.freeyellow.com" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero.freeyellow.com</A> <BR>Oct (?)		MAFOA Fall Fiero Show<BR>Frederick Maryland<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/easternfiero/events.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/easternfiero/events.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		Atlas All-Pontiac Show<BR>Brandywine Maryland<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/atlas_pontiac.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/atlas_pontiac.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		PA Foliage Cruise<BR>Allentown Pennsylvania<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/pa_cruise.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/pa_cruise.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		Cruisin’ The Coast<BR>Mississippi Gulf Coast<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.cruisinthecoast.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cruisinthecoast.com</A>  <BR>Or: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/goldcoastfiero/general_information.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/goldcoastfiero/general_information.htm</A> <BR>Oct 26-28 (not confirmed)<BR>Pontiac Oakland Club International Car Show<BR>			Prescott Arizona<BR>Info: fierosman@aol.com (Scott Parker)<BR>Nov 22-25 (not confirmed)<BR>Turkey Rod Run<BR>Daytona Int'l Speedway<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.carshows.org/tgeninfo.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.carshows.org/tgeninfo.html</A> <P><BR>||||reg||6
