Z||000006||stimpy||01-17-2001||03:29 PM||||I'm planning on hitting as many open class car shows as possible this season. There is pretty much one every weekend between May and September within driving distance. If nothing else, it is a fun, cheap way to get out and meet other car nuts.||||reg||1
Z||000007||2M4 Dale||01-18-2001||12:02 AM||||There is a local show in Ashland Ohio around the end of August. Last year I entered my coupe and took 1st. Place for Best Sports/Compact...I also was in the running for Best of the Eighties. I'll let you know when it is when I find out...lol<p>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 01-18-2001).]||||reg||6
